# Ignore files named *.exe anywhere in the tree, but re-include directories
# whose name happens to end in .exe (e.g. `annotations/nocedit.exe/`).
# The trailing `/` on the negation makes it directory-only; the ignore line
# above still catches every real `.exe` file.
*.exe
!*.exe/
*.jpg
*.gif
*.html
*.INI
*.ini
*.dll
*.isu
*.js
stderr.txt
gtfo.txt
